      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-297823",
      ":question/problem": "![](images/07/07f5fba5f27bafa5107a3f4a0399e31467de0c9237e9b89c469a282d42f38996.png)\n\nTwo groups of students recorded the number of hours they studied over the weekend. This information for Group X is summarized in the histogram above. For the students in Group Y, their average number of study hours was $4$.\n\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\nThe mean number of study hours in Group X is\n{{field-1}}.\n\nThe mean for Group Y is\n{{field-2}}\nthe mean for Group X.\n\nBased on the mean values, students in\n{{field-3}}\nstudied more hours on average.\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
